    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How We Became Heroes</strong> is a stylish and intense 2.5D shooter with roguelite elements, where you pilot a single ship through waves of grotesque enemies in chaotic, stunning environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the edge of collapse, a reluctant pilot is thrown into battle\u2014not for glory, but to survive. With every run, you unlock upgrades, sharpen your skills, and face increasingly unpredictable challenges. Featuring tight gameplay, a cinematic atmosphere, and colossal boss fights, each mission delivers tension, challenge, and a shot at redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by timeless shoot \u2018em ups with a modern, narrative-driven twist, this is a game that tests your reflexes, your strategy\u2014and your will to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover <strong>how we became heroes</strong>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How We Became Heroes</strong> is a stylish and intense 2.5D shooter with roguelite elements, where you pilot a single ship through waves of grotesque enemies in chaotic, stunning environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the edge of collapse, a reluctant pilot is thrown into battle\u2014not for glory, but to survive. With every run, you unlock upgrades, sharpen your skills, and face increasingly unpredictable challenges. Featuring tight gameplay, a cinematic atmosphere, and colossal boss fights, each mission delivers tension, challenge, and a shot at redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by timeless shoot \u2018em ups with a modern, narrative-driven twist, this is a game that tests your reflexes, your strategy\u2014and your will to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover <strong>how we became heroes</strong>?</p>",
    "short_description": "A 2.5D roguelite shooter where you pilot a single ship through intense battles, grotesque enemy hordes, massive bosses, and evolving challenges with persistent upgrades.",
